    "name": "Aboleo: Shadow of the Crown",
    "steam_appid": 2615480,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615480/extras/98aec59db8572f14b1307f947a6a5202.avif?t=1747144546\" width=540 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This<strong>\u00a0</strong>is an RPG about tough choices in a kingdom that\u2019s falling apart. You play as someone with a complicated past\u2014people aren\u2019t sure whether to trust you, and honestly, you're still figuring that out yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world\u2019s open and alive, full of people just trying to survive. Some will ask for your help. Others will try to use you. It\u2019s up to you whether you become the one who brings peace, or the one who takes power for yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no clear right or wrong here\u2014just consequences. Every decision matters, and how this story ends is entirely up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615480/extras/e235d0d7fe6a2a4d1fbffb030353b9ec.avif?t=1747144546\" width=540 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape Your Legacy</strong><br>Your choices matter. Every decision you make shifts the fate of the kingdom\u2014bring hope, or leave ruin in your wake. Whether you're a savior or a tyrant, your story leaves a mark that won\u2019t be forgotten.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World Worth Exploring</strong><br>From quiet villages to unforgiving wilds, explore a massive, hand-crafted world packed with secrets, danger, and beauty. No two paths are the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Easy Choices</strong><br>Help rebuild a broken kingdom\u2014or burn it down. Face tough moral decisions where the right answer isn\u2019t always clear, and your actions have real consequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Everyone Has a Motive</strong><br>Nobody\u2019s what they seem. Uncover hidden agendas and secrets buried deep beneath the surface. Trust is earned\u2014and easily broken.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight Your Way</strong><br>Master a combat system that bends to your style. Wield swords, cast spells, or mix both. Whether you walk the path of honor or domination, you\u2019ll need every skill to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ally or Annihilate</strong><br>Stand with the people or take what you want by force. Your alliances, your enemies, your war to wage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover the Truth</strong><br>Unravel the mystery behind your past\u2014and the future of the realm. The story twists, turns, and keeps you guessing until the final moment.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shadow of the Crown</strong> is a dark fantasy RPG where right and wrong blur, and power comes at a cost. Will you rise to lead\u2014or crush everything beneath your boots?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The crown waits. Will you claim it?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615480/extras/b39998facdd2b2ef115e382d688633c9.avif?t=1747144546\" width=304 height=304 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615480/extras/53384ec06a19466adf125947cb89e694.avif?t=1747144546\" width=304 height=304 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615480/extras/98aec59db8572f14b1307f947a6a5202.avif?t=1747144546\" width=540 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This<strong>\u00a0</strong>is an RPG about tough choices in a kingdom that\u2019s falling apart. You play as someone with a complicated past\u2014people aren\u2019t sure whether to trust you, and honestly, you're still figuring that out yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world\u2019s open and alive, full of people just trying to survive. Some will ask for your help. Others will try to use you. It\u2019s up to you whether you become the one who brings peace, or the one who takes power for yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no clear right or wrong here\u2014just consequences. Every decision matters, and how this story ends is entirely up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615480/extras/e235d0d7fe6a2a4d1fbffb030353b9ec.avif?t=1747144546\" width=540 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape Your Legacy</strong><br>Your choices matter. Every decision you make shifts the fate of the kingdom\u2014bring hope, or leave ruin in your wake. Whether you're a savior or a tyrant, your story leaves a mark that won\u2019t be forgotten.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World Worth Exploring</strong><br>From quiet villages to unforgiving wilds, explore a massive, hand-crafted world packed with secrets, danger, and beauty. No two paths are the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Easy Choices</strong><br>Help rebuild a broken kingdom\u2014or burn it down. Face tough moral decisions where the right answer isn\u2019t always clear, and your actions have real consequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Everyone Has a Motive</strong><br>Nobody\u2019s what they seem. Uncover hidden agendas and secrets buried deep beneath the surface. Trust is earned\u2014and easily broken.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight Your Way</strong><br>Master a combat system that bends to your style. Wield swords, cast spells, or mix both. Whether you walk the path of honor or domination, you\u2019ll need every skill to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ally or Annihilate</strong><br>Stand with the people or take what you want by force. Your alliances, your enemies, your war to wage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover the Truth</strong><br>Unravel the mystery behind your past\u2014and the future of the realm. The story twists, turns, and keeps you guessing until the final moment.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shadow of the Crown</strong> is a dark fantasy RPG where right and wrong blur, and power comes at a cost. Will you rise to lead\u2014or crush everything beneath your boots?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The crown waits. Will you claim it?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615480/extras/b39998facdd2b2ef115e382d688633c9.avif?t=1747144546\" width=304 height=304 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615480/extras/53384ec06a19466adf125947cb89e694.avif?t=1747144546\" width=304 height=304 /></span></p>",
